  "stack_audit": "All production VT paths are nonrecursive/direct. 70,352 B is sum of every emitted VT function frame, a conservative bound (not observed high-water). All production types align <=16; no extra dynamic alignment. Compiler entry, copy helper, external call and panic/trap bridges leave sp unchanged; machine.s0 leaves sp unchanged. 131,072 B dedicated stack leaves 60,720 B under this bound. Fatal emergency vector does not use stack. User traps/IRQ are not supported."
